tom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":1,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"An ancient Greek mathematician, physicist, engineer, inventor, and astronomer, his work laid the foundation for numerous scientific fields and his inventions have captivated the imagination for centuries.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":2,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"Although many details of his life remain shrouded in mystery, his surviving writings and the accounts of later historians paint a picture of a man of immense intellect and practical ingenuity.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVNpUpQ_zRGeoY3AHeRQYfF809beOAFnMQuvmiYUCGDz6Xwe2gKqfhDjwAMMShNStZxywV1FLpuG9m3KXXjya-CFWxcGCad4TtttPr2JPqOGBPhH4IP__qSLG4dqxMP7qNDp3NNmYW2XxG1KOdlLzNRibT\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":3,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Born in the bustling port city of Syracuse, Sicily, which was then a self-governing Greek colony, Archimedes' father was an astronomer named Phidias.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGU7ecK9eo_c0FiLA8PKagzgSIvi88y5_Qg7V5RWSFkjMXZU5lCEY3awjZgIWfaZ48GiuJLI-uMtFflbbGhDRCQ7N8HxQiNL_9Ds9m29bWaklONBjIpiLfBe-RImLWHZOw2G2c9AxocJoA3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":4,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"Born in the bustling port city of Syracuse, Sicily, which was then a self-governing Greek colony, Archimedes' father was an astronomer named Phidias.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG1EY5RVjSdhuhQbRJRxsj4KPaOtgUFGL7ZNYxMkTY5Sl30Ya-_KV2kab0ib7IbsKTN-8Grqq4lS6mPKCKLKCBZUOHUP89QKcwc75OE3d9Sz_y-vPv40WToEO_ZsrItV18CK3fJ-6Js3ujjf28jkQcWE8ojkMTGzg0=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":5,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"It is believed that Archimedes spent some of his youth in Alexandria, Egypt, the intellectual heart of the ancient world, where he would have studied with the successors of the famed mathematician Euclid.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVNpUpQ_zRGeoY3AHeRQYfF809beOAFnMQuvmiYUCGDz6Xwe2gKqfhDjwAMMShNStZxywV1FLpuG9m3KXXjya-CFWxcGCad4TtttPr2JPqOGBPhH4IP__qSLG4dqxMP7qNDp3NNmYW2XxG1KOdlLzNRibT\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":6,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ebsco.com\",\"data\":\"It is believed that Archimedes spent some of his youth in Alexandria, Egypt, the intellectual heart of the ancient world, where he would have studied with the successors of the famed mathematician Euclid.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEpGaWaRGl1zmre_1dgq4x9BLYUrBCK7tTBVhi5A73P0UMv3b95gdM_mq0hQmNiMT-8qERDAe2kz4KGGIgCGGfaXrTZ_WBbMv-TwRjanXCRU3LliQwKnTZ6K3BhYEPS5WJABHvZr7-rFOVt6f75xVBql293ZhY=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":7,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"This experience likely connected him with other leading thinkers of his time, with whom he corresponded throughout his life.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGU7ecK9eo_c0FiLA8PKagzgSIvi88y5_Qg7V5RWSFkjMXZU5lCEY3awjZgIWfaZ48GiuJLI-uMtFflbbGhDRCQ7N8HxQiNL_9Ds9m29bWaklONBjIpiLfBe-RImLWHZOw2G2c9AxocJoA3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":8,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ebsco.com\",\"data\":\"Archimedes was known to have a close relationship with King Hiero II of Syracuse and his son, Gelon, for whom he undertook various scientific and practical projects.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEpGaWaRGl1zmre_1dgq4x9BLYUrBCK7tTBVhi5A73P0UMv3b95gdM_mq0hQmNiMT-8qERDAe2kz4KGGIgCGGfaXrTZ_WBbMv-TwRjanXCRU3LliQwKnTZ6K3BhYEPS5WJABHvZr7-rFOVt6f75xVBql293ZhY=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":9,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"Despite orders from the Roman general, Marcus Claudius Marcellus, that the renowned thinker should not be harmed, Archimedes was killed by a Roman soldier.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":10,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Despite orders from the Roman general, Marcus Claudius Marcellus, that the renowned thinker should not be harmed, Archimedes was killed by a Roman soldier.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGU7ecK9eo_c0FiLA8PKagzgSIvi88y5_Qg7V5RWSFkjMXZU5lCEY3awjZgIWfaZ48GiuJLI-uMtFflbbGhDRCQ7N8HxQiNL_9Ds9m29bWaklONBjIpiLfBe-RImLWHZOw2G2c9AxocJoA3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":11,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"One popular account suggests he was so engrossed in a mathematical diagram that he refused to leave his work when confronted by the soldier.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGU7ecK9eo_c0FiLA8PKagzgSIvi88y5_Qg7V5RWSFkjMXZU5lCEY3awjZgIWfaZ48GiuJLI-uMtFflbbGhDRCQ7N8HxQiNL_9Ds9m29bWaklONBjIpiLfBe-RImLWHZOw2G2c9AxocJoA3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"So profound was his dedication to his mathematical discoveries that he requested his tomb be marked with a sphere and a cylinder, representing one of his proudest geometrical findings.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Approximation of Pi (\\u03c0):** Archimedes was one of the first to devise a method for calculating an approximation of pi with remarkable accuracy for his time.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"superprof.co.uk\",\"data\":\"*   **Approximation of Pi (\\u03c0):** Archimedes was one of the first to devise a method for calculating an approximation of pi with remarkable accuracy for his time.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEkZa_TqBfFZRRWLGihiEncKG3w4g9gaCOHbWrAhL-diBL_gj1LbrA7v4xXP2a9ZkHYveirPWuRuwA7fl5ms-x6dZPgGwPxi0F2DQyh0OaR5UcEAm4lDqPbGloxe_bcSx7UCsrCx99x4hcnBvI70Asvhfkz28O3LClo85C1cOA_10V1Qep84v1KSr6KJa4chX6\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"He achieved this by inscribing and circumscribing polygons around a circle, demonstrating that pi lay between 3 10/71 and 3 1/7.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGU7ecK9eo_c0FiLA8PKagzgSIvi88y5_Qg7V5RWSFkjMXZU5lCEY3awjZgIWfaZ48GiuJLI-uMtFflbbGhDRCQ7N8HxQiNL_9Ds9m29bWaklONBjIpiLfBe-RImLWHZOw2G2c9AxocJoA3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"superprof.co.uk\",\"data\":\"He achieved this by inscribing and circumscribing polygons around a circle, demonstrating that pi lay between 3 10/71 and 3 1/7.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEkZa_TqBfFZRRWLGihiEncKG3w4g9gaCOHbWrAhL-diBL_gj1LbrA7v4xXP2a9ZkHYveirPWuRuwA7fl5ms-x6dZPgGwPxi0F2DQyh0OaR5UcEAm4lDqPbGloxe_bcSx7UCsrCx99x4hcnBvI70Asvhfkz28O3LClo85C1cOA_10V1Qep84v1KSr6KJa4chX6\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"*   **Precursor to Calculus:** Centuries before its formal development, Archimedes developed techniques that anticipated integral calculus.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVNpUpQ_zRGeoY3AHeRQYfF809beOAFnMQuvmiYUCGDz6Xwe2gKqfhDjwAMMShNStZxywV1FLpuG9m3KXXjya-CFWxcGCad4TtttPr2JPqOGBPhH4IP__qSLG4dqxMP7qNDp3NNmYW2XxG1KOdlLzNRibT\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"He used the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" a process of using infinitesimals, to rigorously prove a multitude of geometric theorems.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"superprof.co.uk\",\"data\":\"This allowed him to calculate the areas and volumes of various geometric figures with curved surfaces, which was previously impossible.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEkZa_TqBfFZRRWLGihiEncKG3w4g9gaCOHbWrAhL-diBL_gj1LbrA7v4xXP2a9ZkHYveirPWuRuwA7fl5ms-x6dZPgGwPxi0F2DQyh0OaR5UcEAm4lDqPbGloxe_bcSx7UCsrCx99x4hcnBvI70Asvhfkz28O3LClo85C1cOA_10V1Qep84v1KSr6KJa4chX6\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"abakus-center.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Geometry:** Archimedes made significant advances in geometry, including calculating the surface area and volume of a sphere.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEiVSiuA_9e2-eLI6rM_3kBwUOSByd-55gBsCKhpKnNPI1Zpgqd075KhuWJC8LO6_ueQXccJa7xDaB8NjEKZbhVaQMK72_Ab0YW45u8z99UoWrek1fBMsklPIaPQGtYuWimQnNOxIjXYE4Ve4etCbaD0Guj\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"He famously proved that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of a cylinder that encloses it.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGU7ecK9eo_c0FiLA8PKagzgSIvi88y5_Qg7V5RWSFkjMXZU5lCEY3awjZgIWfaZ48GiuJLI-uMtFflbbGhDRCQ7N8HxQiNL_9Ds9m29bWaklONBjIpiLfBe-RImLWHZOw2G2c9AxocJoA3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"omniwham.com\",\"data\":\"He famously proved that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of a cylinder that encloses it.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFuhK4GIBuX-yubymbb23VPsAzL2WzPyHnMCXFvnWBaPJJOkYzj5AbKJRqsoMxGGHn3eh1Q2grWUwMTC3n3ReiONjHczGartyVT0FNDVktBRon5dWMg_jxOBy-M0m-zC49YcaHZa5ieF5-VXY87tYZqAlkL_fQHhe8p_ENEDs4-P4yz52fRsnmnD62rQIo=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"He also investigated the properties of the Archimedean spiral and the areas of parabolas and ellipses.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":24,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **System for Large Numbers:** In his work \\\"The Sand Reckoner,\\\" Archimedes devised a system using exponentiation to express and work with incredibly large numbers, demonstrating that he could calculate a number greater than the number of grains of sand required to fill the universe.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":25,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Archimedes' Principle:** Perhaps his most famous discovery, Archimedes' principle states that a body immersed in a fluid experiences a buoyant force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGU7ecK9eo_c0FiLA8PKagzgSIvi88y5_Qg7V5RWSFkjMXZU5lCEY3awjZgIWfaZ48GiuJLI-uMtFflbbGhDRCQ7N8HxQiNL_9Ds9m29bWaklONBjIpiLfBe-RImLWHZOw2G2c9AxocJoA3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":26,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"The legendary \\\"Eureka!\\\" moment is said to have occurred when he realized this principle while in his bath, subsequently running through the streets unclothed in his excitement.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFIeWBmbMjkPwEdZa7Avg4OVUvjMEKMEakbJ8WviVC_qiSPhdSwHEyhBUIuqqTGCDB9nNoFrK3VEJa8_UfqRF8OFW38ejQL84VZCnYsUisaRoxEnoMhOuI5yijhOyDqSoy5F4eRIPlT78yZcoQq3OdxyUc5Rvt1LD9NSvSmzu_rYW8AxVc_Z4a9nLsSgfzJZJ37KHxS5tWU_MbnxGao\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":27,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"This principle of hydrostatics was a foundational concept in the study of fluids.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFIeWBmbMjkPwEdZa7Avg4OVUvjMEKMEakbJ8WviVC_qiSPhdSwHEyhBUIuqqTGCDB9nNoFrK3VEJa8_UfqRF8OFW38ejQL84VZCnYsUisaRoxEnoMhOuI5yijhOyDqSoy5F4eRIPlT78yZcoQq3OdxyUc5Rvt1LD9NSvSmzu_rYW8AxVc_Z4a9nLsSgfzJZJ37KHxS5tWU_MbnxGao\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":28,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"abakus-center.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** Archimedes was the first to mathematically describe the principle of the lever, a cornerstone of mechanics.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEiVSiuA_9e2-eLI6rM_3kBwUOSByd-55gBsCKhpKnNPI1Zpgqd075KhuWJC8LO6_ueQXccJa7xDaB8NjEKZbhVaQMK72_Ab0YW45u8z99UoWrek1fBMsklPIaPQGtYuWimQnNOxIjXYE4Ve4etCbaD0Guj\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":29,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"omniwham.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** Archimedes was the first to mathematically describe the principle of the lever, a cornerstone of mechanics.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFuhK4GIBuX-yubymbb23VPsAzL2WzPyHnMCXFvnWBaPJJOkYzj5AbKJRqsoMxGGHn3eh1Q2grWUwMTC3n3ReiONjHczGartyVT0FNDVktBRon5dWMg_jxOBy-M0m-zC49YcaHZa5ieF5-VXY87tYZqAlkL_fQHhe8p_ENEDs4-P4yz52fRsnmnD62rQIo=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":30,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"abakus-center.com\",\"data\":\"He famously declared, \\\"Give me a place to stand, and I will move the Earth,\\\" highlighting the power of mechanical advantage.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEiVSiuA_9e2-eLI6rM_3kBwUOSByd-55gBsCKhpKnNPI1Zpgqd075KhuWJC8LO6_ueQXccJa7xDaB8NjEKZbhVaQMK72_Ab0YW45u8z99UoWrek1fBMsklPIaPQGtYuWimQnNOxIjXYE4Ve4etCbaD0Guj\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":31,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This invention is a machine with a revolving screw-shaped blade inside a tube, used to raise water from a lower to a higher level.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVNpUpQ_zRGeoY3AHeRQYfF809beOAFnMQuvmiYUCGDz6Xwe2gKqfhDjwAMMShNStZxywV1FLpuG9m3KXXjya-CFWxcGCad4TtttPr2JPqOGBPhH4IP__qSLG4dqxMP7qNDp3NNmYW2XxG1KOdlLzNRibT\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":32,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"It was a significant innovation for irrigation and is a testament to his practical problem-solving skills.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVNpUpQ_zRGeoY3AHeRQYfF809beOAFnMQuvmiYUCGDz6Xwe2gKqfhDjwAMMShNStZxywV1FLpuG9m3KXXjya-CFWxcGCad4TtttPr2JPqOGBPhH4IP__qSLG4dqxMP7qNDp3NNmYW2XxG1KOdlLzNRibT\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":33,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"superprof.co.uk\",\"data\":\"It was a significant innovation for irrigation and is a testament to his practical problem-solving skills.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEkZa_TqBfFZRRWLGihiEncKG3w4g9gaCOHbWrAhL-diBL_gj1LbrA7v4xXP2a9ZkHYveirPWuRuwA7fl5ms-x6dZPgGwPxi0F2DQyh0OaR5UcEAm4lDqPbGloxe_bcSx7UCsrCx99x4hcnBvI70Asvhfkz28O3LClo85C1cOA_10V1Qep84v1KSr6KJa4chX6\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":34,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"Variations of this device are still used today.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVNpUpQ_zRGeoY3AHeRQYfF809beOAFnMQuvmiYUCGDz6Xwe2gKqfhDjwAMMShNStZxywV1FLpuG9m3KXXjya-CFWxcGCad4TtttPr2JPqOGBPhH4IP__qSLG4dqxMP7qNDp3NNmYW2XxG1KOdlLzNRibT\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":35,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **War Machines:** During the siege of Syracuse, Archimedes is credited with designing a number of ingenious defensive war machines.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":36,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"These included powerful catapults and compound pulleys.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVoK8Wc6Imydk3ls0K4UBquC9MgA8pU26_2gmBCBXK7_l0zMZEg3PDsJh4VKdkBsXK1AeRt2MUTIKwjwZGVOFsyDlEcumQ8aOPNcd-WFuoZ6N732vX-1uPLaywtIEImm0Wc7s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":37,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"These included powerful catapults and compound pulleys.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVNpUpQ_zRGeoY3AHeRQYfF809beOAFnMQuvmiYUCGDz6Xwe2gKqfhDjwAMMShNStZxywV1FLpuG9m3KXXjya-CFWxcGCad4TtttPr2JPqOGBPhH4IP__qSLG4dqxMP7qNDp3NNmYW2XxG1KOdlLzNRibT\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":38,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"One of the more debated inventions is the \\\"heat ray\\\" or \\\"death ray,\\\" a system of mirrors supposedly used to focus sunlight onto Roman ships and set them ablaze.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVNpUpQ_zRGeoY3AHeRQYfF809beOAFnMQuvmiYUCGDz6Xwe2gKqfhDjwAMMShNStZxywV1FLpuG9m3KXXjya-CFWxcGCad4TtttPr2JPqOGBPhH4IP__qSLG4dqxMP7qNDp3NNmYW2XxG1KOdlLzNRibT\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":39,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"One of the more debated inventions is the \\\"heat ray\\\" or \\\"death ray,\\\" a system of mirrors supposedly used to focus sunlight onto Roman ships and set them ablaze.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFIeWBmbMjkPwEdZa7Avg4OVUvjMEKMEakbJ8WviVC_qiSPhdSwHEyhBUIuqqTGCDB9nNoFrK3VEJa8_UfqRF8OFW38ejQL84VZCnYsUisaRoxEnoMhOuI5yijhOyDqSoy5F4eRIPlT78yZcoQq3OdxyUc5Rvt1LD9NSvSmzu_rYW8AxVc_Z4a9nLsSgfzJZJ37KHxS5tWU_MbnxGao\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":40,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Odometer:** The Roman architect and engineer Vitruvius credited Archimedes with inventing the first odometer during the First Punic War, a device to measure distance.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFIeWBmbMjkPwEdZa7Avg4OVUvjMEKMEakbJ8WviVC_qiSPhdSwHEyhBUIuqqTGCDB9nNoFrK3VEJa8_UfqRF8OFW38ejQL84VZCnYsUisaRoxEnoMhOuI5yijhOyDqSoy5F4eRIPlT78yZcoQq3OdxyUc5Rvt1LD9NSvSmzu_rYW8AxVc_Z4a9nLsSgfzJZJ37KHxS5tWU_MbnxGao\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":41,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Ship *Syracusia*:** Under the patronage of King Hiero II, Archimedes is said to have designed a massive ship, the *Syracusia*, which was one of the largest of its time and featured a library, gymnasium, and even a temple.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFIeWBmbMjkPwEdZa7Avg4OVUvjMEKMEakbJ8WviVC_qiSPhdSwHEyhBUIuqqTGCDB9nNoFrK3VEJa8_UfqRF8OFW38ejQL84VZCnYsUisaRoxEnoMhOuI5yijhOyDqSoy5F4eRIPlT78yZcoQq3OdxyUc5Rvt1LD9NSvSmzu_rYW8AxVc_Z4a9nLsSgfzJZJ37KHxS5tWU_MbnxGao\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":42,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ebsco.com\",\"data\":\"His work was so far ahead of its time that its full impact wasn't realized until centuries later, influencing countless mathematicians and scientists, including Galileo and Newton, and cementing his status as one of history's greatest minds.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEpGaWaRGl1zmre_1dgq4x9BLYUrBCK7tTBVhi5A73P0UMv3b95gdM_mq0hQmNiMT-8qERDAe2kz4KGGIgCGGfaXrTZ_WBbMv-TwRjanXCRU3LliQwKnTZ6K3BhYEPS5WJABHvZr7-rFOVt6f75xVBql293ZhY=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\"\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"delta\":{}}],\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":11,\"completion_tokens\":1247,\"total_tokens\":1258},\"id\":\"45ebef6e-223a-4cf8-9b21-7940b6237027\",\"created\":1777016293,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n",
